version: "2026.11.16"
abstract: >-
  An open reference on cost segregation and bonus depreciation for U.S. real
  estate: MACRS recovery periods for building components, the bonus
  depreciation rate by placed-in-service year including the January 19, 2025
  acquisition-date rule, and Form 3115 look-back studies, each tied to a
  primary source (IRC §168, IRS Publication 946, Rev. Proc. 87-56, IRS
  Publication 5653, IRS Notice 2026-11).
keywords:
  - cost segregation
  - bonus depreciation
  - MACRS
  - real estate
  - tax
  - depreciation
